TITLE="Pemvidutide and Drinking: What a New Trial Found"
FNAME="Pemvidutide and Drinking - What a New Trial Found"
META="A new pemvidutide trial found this weekly peptide shot cut heavy drinking days and body weight in adults with alcohol use disorder. Here's what to know."
